      "updated_at": "2020-06-22T21:36:12Z",
      "body": "When you say 'see group activity' you mean that others are still sending message to you in that group, and you receive them? If so, it suggests that your attempt to leave the group was incomplete on your phone. Nobody should still be sending messages to you if they believe that you've left the group.\r\n\r\nI'd recommend that you have someone re-add you to the group, then leave again. It would give your \"I'm leaving\" message another chance to hit all devices, including your paired desktop device.",
