      "updated_at": "2020-07-11T16:04:31Z",
      "body": "Wanted to report the same issue, but from the other side. I am part of a group with three members. Unbeknownst to any of us, a fourth member who left the group months ago has continued receiving our messages on their desktop client.\r\n\r\nThere is no indication in the app that this fourth party is still receiving messages. This is a total breach of the privacy of the group, since there's no way to audit who our messages are being sent to.\r\n\r\nI'm happy to provide whatever logs may be needed to help diagnose. Thanks!",
